    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d57">

                <pb facs="0152" n="50" xml:id="pg50"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.572/30: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commission to Negotiate
                            Peace to the Acting Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-01-31T21:00:00+00:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 31,
                                1919, 9 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received
                            January 31, 9 p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>520. Your 397 and 490.<anchor n="58" xml:id="d57-f1"/> Consider it desirable that
                    Treaty of Commerce and Navigation [with] Norway, with exception of articles 13
                    and 14, be continued for time being and that similar course be adopted in
                    connection with Spanish treaty. Lansing.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Am</hi>[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >erican</hi>] <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mission</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
